# =============================================================================
# Semgrep exclusions.
#
# Writing this file REPLACES Semgrep's built-in template rather than adding to it,
# so every default below is reproduced verbatim from
# semgrep/templates/.semgrepignore (v1.97.0). Removing one silently starts scanning
# node_modules and friends.
#
# The scan is run by the shared reusable workflow as
#   docker run -v "$PWD:/src" -w /src semgrep/semgrep:<ver> semgrep scan --config=... .
# so the working directory is this repository root and this file is picked up.
# =============================================================================

# --- Semgrep defaults (do not edit; keep in step with the template) ----------
